menu "Pajoniiir migration options"

config PAJONIIIR_P4_LOCAL_CONTROLLER
    bool "Build experimental P4-local FLX4 controller path"
    default n
    help
        Compile the dual-controller USB Host owner, direct FLX4 USB-MIDI
        transport, local semantic runtime, local profile activation and direct
        MIDI LED feedback into the production ESP32-P4 firmware.

        This option is deliberately disabled in sdkconfig.defaults. The normal
        product image continues to use the proven ESP32-S3 control and cue-audio
        path until the physical dual-USB acceptance matrix passes. The enabled
        variant keeps the S3 UART transport alive as a fallback and for A/B
        validation.

endmenu
